title: "PCB Defect Inspector: YOLOv8-Powered AI Visual Inspection System"
type: software
abstract: >-
  Research and demonstration prototype that runs a trained YOLOv8 model on PCB
  images through a Streamlit dashboard and exports annotated images and CSV reports.
